Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:40:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 195/220] [ae-patch] Add a review frequency to Settings >
 Roles: Weekly, Every 2 weeks or Monthly

The Preset insights block showed a fixed 'Every 2 weeks'. It is now a three-way choice saved with the insights setting (absent means Every 2 weeks, as before). The hint says reviews run Monday 07:00 (server time), Monthly on the first Monday, and, on Monthly only, that Run now in mid-month can push the next review out by up to 8 weeks. The buttons use aria-disabled while saving and the hint is tied to the group with aria-describedby.
